# Line endings are LF, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Two gates read bytes and both were unreadable without this. `catalog:check` compares the
# generated contract projections byte for byte, because those files are published artifacts
# and their bytes *are* the contract. `biome check` formats to LF and reported twenty errors
# whose only content was a carriage return.
#
# Both were red on Windows and green in CI, which is the worst arrangement available: the
# check is unreadable exactly where the code is edited, and believed exactly where nobody is
# looking. `core.autocrlf` was converting on checkout with nothing here to say otherwise —
# the repository itself has always been LF, so this declares what was already true rather
# than changing anything.
#
# `text=auto` sniffs content, so binaries are left alone without needing to be listed.
* text=auto eol=lf
